      },
      "text": "Decision record 12 supersedes the legacy persistence rule and fixes the\ndomain isolation boundary for every service in this program.\n\nThe domain layer owns its own invariants. A persistence adapter may read a\ndomain object and may never construct one from a row, because a row that\nconstructs a domain object has moved the boundary without saying so.\n\nThis decision is current as of the revision recorded beside it. It replaces\ndecision record 4, whose persistence boundary rule is retained only as history.\n"
    },
