        },
        "usable_as": "HISTORICAL_CONTEXT_ONLY"
      },
      "text": "Decision record 4 on the legacy persistence rule. The persistence\nboundary here is the table, and the domain isolation rule follows the schema.\n\nA persistence row is a domain object. The persistence boundary is drawn at the\nquery, and a domain module reads the persistence rows it needs directly, so the\ndomain isolation boundary and the persistence boundary are the same boundary.\n\nPersistence, persistence boundary, domain isolation: this record was the\ndecision in force before decision record 12 replaced it.\n"
    },
