      "text": "Incident review for the scheduler stall observed during the checkout\nwindow.\n\nThe scheduler stopped draining its queue for eleven minutes. The trigger was a\nlock held across a retry, and the retry was itself scheduled by the lock holder.\n\nThis review records what was observed. It is not a reproduction of the failure,\nand nothing here was rerun.\n"
    },
