      "text": "Service objective for the checkout path.\n\nThe gateway answers a checkout request within the stated latency budget for the\nstated share of requests, measured over a rolling window.\n\nThe objective is a target somebody agreed to. It is not a measurement, and this\nrecord carries none.\n"
